<title>USA: DSP Communications increases share buyback.</title>
<headline>DSP Communications increases share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>CUPERTINO, Calif. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>DSP Communications Inc said Monday its board had increased by four million the number of shares authorized to be repurchased under the buyback plan announced in April.</p>
<p>This brings the total number of shares under the repurchase plan since its inception to eight million.</p>
<p>To date, DSP has completed the repurchase of 3,665,000 shares.</p>
<p>As of May 16, the company had cash, cash equivalents and short-term investments in the amount of about $111 million, it said.</p>
</text>
